    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n91252" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτύξαγρις</span></b>  and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πύξαγρις</span></b> , ὁ, name of the crab
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>which extracts</i> the
			flesh of the oyster from its shell by putting a small stone between
			the <i>valves</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτύχες</span> or
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυξία</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Zonar.
			</span></i></div>
